{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Like one bereft.</b> Some say \"mad,\" like אלכה ערום ושולל (Micah 1:8), אשתוללו אבירי לב (Psalms 76:6). And it is possible that all are from the root שלל, to strip of property; then משתולל is a verb in the hitpa'el paradigm."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 59, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:18.427961898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}